# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=thunar
pkgver=4.20.0
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Thunar, a fast and simple file manager"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://xfce.org/"
license=(GPL-2.0-or-later)
depends=(exo libxfce4ui xfconf gtk3 pcre2)
source=("https://archive.xfce.org/src/xfce/thunar/4.20/thunar-$pkgver.tar.bz2")
sha256sums=('27731a76f3aecf3752b1ca35afad89e264c52244f70083d933507dd4a17548b0')

build() {
    cd thunar-$pkgver
    # Wayland only, like the rest of Yūrei's GTK
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static \
        --disable-debug --disable-introspection --disable-x11 --enable-wayland --disable-gudev --disable-notifications --disable-exif --disable-tpa-plugin --disable-wallpaper-plugin --disable-uca-plugin
    make
}

package() {
    cd thunar-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
